<title>USA: Badger Meter named in California suit.</title>
<headline>Badger Meter named in California suit.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Badger Meter Inc on Friday said it was named in a lawsuit filed in a California state court by the Natural Resources Defense Fund and the Environmental Law Foundation.</p>
<p>The suit alleges lead has leached from bronze meters sold by the company in California, a violation under that state's Proposition 65.</p>
<p>The suit has not been on Badger yet, the company said. Badger said it thought it had an excellent defense and that any resolution of the litigation would not be in a material amount.</p>
<p>Badger makes industrial products using flow measurement and control technology.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
